sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Bio as Biometric (Ch 21)
    participant PSP as PSP SDK
    participant BE as Backend (ledger authority)

    User->>App: add card
    App->>Bio: authenticate sensitive action (Ch 21)
    Bio-->>App: ok
    App->>PSP: tokenize card (PAN stays with PSP, PCI, Ch 23)
    PSP-->>App: token + brand/last4
    App->>BE: store token (authed, Ch 19)
    User->>App: spend 100 from wallet
    App->>Bio: authenticate spend
    App->>BE: debit 100, idempotencyKey (Ch 15)
    BE->>BE: validate balance >= 100, atomic debit (server-authoritative)
    BE-->>App: new balance (synced, Ch 32) - NEVER a local-balance spend
